config SPACEMIT_HMP
	bool "Spacemit HMP support"
	depends on SMP && ARCH_SPACEMIT
	help
	  Say y here to enable the HMP feature support.
	  This feature categorizes the CPU cores within the
	  SOC into two distinct types, each running different
	  types of threads.
